### Feature OrderDetail — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH)
### Modalidad JWT + RBAC. `status` no se envía: el estado solo cambia con
### PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/order-details/{{id}}/deactivate (borrado lógico).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### UPDATE (PUT)
# @name updateOrderDetailPut
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/order-details/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitValue": 12500,
  "total": 25000,
  "observations": "Sin salsas"
}

### UPDATE (PATCH)
# @name updateOrderDetailPatch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/order-details/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "observations": "Sin salsas"
}
